msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord gave my corpse a casual glance,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and said stonefaced,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫领主瞥了一眼我的尸体，面不改色地说道。"

