#. default-sha256: 663f91c61b2c648c53c1b1023a6222a67051a96b2c3a9e3d306f78372f96d1bd
msgctxt "search2:search2_C396F1A2_065E_47D4_A632_E6625AAA9A30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You’re just as guilty as any of us.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「——你也是同罪」"

#: search2:search2_EA31D2A2_E164_4FEE_8062_FAEFDCADAAE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 308665304b10ff7366998f5d9df249dd56a2e45a5aff5ed4a27364338f992e27
#. default-sha256: 7fd8509fca663ee04f35ff5acf5dfe2ce94c2a32fbc93eae9852da8a182f1950
msgctxt "search2:search2_EA31D2A2_E164_4FEE_8062_FAEFDCADAAE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Not only did they not mourn my death—they argued over whose fault it was. ⟪k:2⟫There "
"was no regret—no remorse.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The young man muttered absentmindedly, ⟪k:6⟫“I... I never "
"⟪k:7⟫wanted⟪k:8⟫ her to die...”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What did his ⟪k:12⟫intentions⟪k:13⟫ matter, "
"though? ⟪k:14⟫It was his betrayal that had ultimately tethered me to this mansion.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫But the fact that they didn’t grieve my death... ⟪k:19⟫and instead squabbled amongst "
"themselves like filthy rats... ⟪k:20⟫was the final straw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　他们不但不为我的死悲伤——反而推脱责任，没有任何道歉的只言片语。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　被独自留下的青年"
"喃喃自语。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　「……不是……我杀的……」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　但是，那又怎么样呢？⟪k:7⟫说到底，都是因为他"
"的背叛，我才被带到这种地方来。⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　然而，当罪恶落实的时候，他们——⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　为了自"
"己而开始丑陋地争斗……⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　在此时此刻，他们丝毫没有为我的死而悲伤。"

#: search2:search2_96C9AB6B_10E5_4F4F_B3E1_7362BC5E85DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9be918747452259d7cd5e4fb866ac648b12074898fe1154b0202d2660b70518
#. default-sha256: f99b1b9198abfc20a69f7acb08b45cdfea35192fb61b267d37f2b9beea580201
msgctxt "search2:search2_96C9AB6B_10E5_4F4F_B3E1_7362BC5E85DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫How could I ⟪k:4⟫not⟪k:5⟫ despise them?⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫这叫我……怎么能不恨？"

#: search2:search2_F30E9911_97B5_4F96_A930_941C37493A57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec6f03d577dfb7e4bb4c44f2fc1bc84cbdda12c063f862ecebc2ab736ef979f4
#. default-sha256: 9f85be101964b611fa7992a0db683886434ae717a933b9a3e4eddd89fe72efec
msgctxt "search2:search2_F30E9911_97B5_4F96_A930_941C37493A57"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t believe I actually had the power to perform miracles when I was alive. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"was all faith—⟪k:3⟫the illusion of belief.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was neither a saint nor a witch.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The blood wine was only effective because people placed their faith in the other "
"“Saintess.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I was only ever human."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　生前的我，一定没有奇迹的力量。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　那是建立在信仰上的——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　需要诚心诚意才有"
"效果。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　我不是圣女也不是魔女。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　我的血之所以能成为药——⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　也是因为对"
"新圣女的信仰吧。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　其实，我只是普通的人类。"

#: search2:search2_B4504D02_0981_443C_B804_2831336A7ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9df4ffa2b690d643b01c5c7c4a4167b54efe7b2cf7f6b3952f4df3bfae594d5
#. default-sha256: 3b3c3e3c208ac385dc0b7f60b5c437fecaf82cb60d36a78dc723c56e0fa2bc77
msgctxt "search2:search2_B4504D02_0981_443C_B804_2831336A7ECA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And so I made my “wish.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Most people might consider it a curse, but to "
"me, it was most certainly a wish. ⟪k:5⟫And my Father—or maybe the Devil—granted that wish!⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫From the garden, ⟪k:10⟫there rose a scream. ⟪k:11⟫The flaxen-haired young man knew "
"that voice better than anyone. ⟪k:12⟫He went deathly pale, darting down the spiral staircase "
"until he reached a window.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫A young girl was on her knees, vomiting blood "
"in the grass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　所以——我「祈愿」了。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　或许有人会把它称为诅咒，但对我来说，这无疑是愿望。⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫　天父，或者恶魔——实现了我的愿望！⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　那个瞬间——⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　院子里发出了惨叫。"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　最先对惨叫声作出反应的，是亚麻发色的青年。⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　他听到惨叫，立马变得脸色苍"
"白，飞奔到螺旋楼梯的窗口。⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　在庭院里，有一个少女吐着血倒下了。"

#: search2:search2_8F9B772C_1BDB_483A_B813_8E71566AA03C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1e4a9e613ba49d409beea0e00f81067f50fa547d58b91052706d70909dc2059
#. default-sha256: d79207d9699d71e39821861b42fd7cae5bdd8c3301ab2d8e70b17c179118568e
msgctxt "search2:search2_8F9B772C_1BDB_483A_B813_8E71566AA03C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“That wine you’re drinking is no medicine!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「你们喝的东西，根本不是什么药！」"

#: search2:search2_A5409E40_F807_4CF8_BCB0_0ECFA2BE964C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1f5be650f447fa7f8b33cd9f5e9831f1e9b1b95588c78d38024909d8577504b
#. default-sha256: 26b1c6ecd316fe021dba7ec5ed427284f6e2a3e5db071903a1876300760e030f
msgctxt "search2:search2_A5409E40_F807_4CF8_BCB0_0ECFA2BE964C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The nun was the first target of their outrage.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What she had claimed to be "
"medicine ⟪k:5⟫had turned out to be blood—an unclean substance. ⟪k:6⟫The blood of a witch, no less."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A servant of the Church—a servant of the Lord—had given her followers blood to "
"drink.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫And at this, their indignation surged uncontrollably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　民众谴责的矛头，最先指向了修女。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　被谎称为药的——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　是污秽的血——⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫　而且还是魔女的血。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　本该是神之奴仆的教会和修女——⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　居然在分发这种东西。"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　所以……⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　民众迅速对教会失去了信任。"

#: search2:search2_210C09EE_BB41_4179_8290_604B318B65B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a44e1dddee9402dc1113998336953677df0ba65b85ed2da498b5d27a4da1fb2
#. default-sha256: 89c308e3de8de82ffee2cea3f67508a9ebdec3167224751dcaba07f66169c68b
msgctxt "search2:search2_210C09EE_BB41_4179_8290_604B318B65B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The people surrounded her, tying her up and throwing her to the ground. ⟪k:2⟫As they "
"prepared to inflict righteous justice upon her, the swordsman soared down the stairs and into the "
"garden, plunging his blade into anyone standing near the nun.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The cries of agony "
"ringing through the church grounds were ear-splitting. ⟪k:6⟫It was no longer a place of God—but "
"Hell on Earth. ⟪k:7⟫Hell built up by the hands of man. ⟪k:8⟫Hell painted red with the blood of "
"their brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　民众准备抓住修女，对她施暴。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　然而那个男人并没有对此视若无睹。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　他下楼"
"到庭院去，拔刀杀掉靠近修女的人。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　那时的叫喊声是何等的凄惨——⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　作为神之庭院的教"
"会，已然化作了地狱。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　但那地狱——是人类一手造成的。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　是他们亲手绘出了这幅地"
"狱画卷。"

#: search2:search2_B507AAEE_793D_4CF3_B5C2_995B9F14FBB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 975c9fdd660e08a0f002e378f164883d509dcf6987eb33dd305ffcefa7564820
#. default-sha256: e8069e4922c3bd4fa33e94ff2708b0e00463c7761434ffee266dad66dbab35cf
msgctxt "search2:search2_B507AAEE_793D_4CF3_B5C2_995B9F14FBB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The people armed themselves with anything they could find and went after the man. ⟪k:2⟫"
"As much of a beast as he may have been, ⟪k:3⟫he stood little chance against such numbers.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫It is the fate of a beast to be exterminated by those he terrorizes. ⟪k:8⟫And once "
"he was gone, the nun had no one left to protect her. ⟪k:9⟫She too was consumed by their frenzy."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫All that remained was an inextinguishable inferno.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Hysteria "
"and despair.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Madness and outrage—⟪k:19⟫and no outlet for it.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫It "
"was a revolt that made the slaves’ uprising at the lord’s manor look like a game."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　民众们拿起各种武器，走向了男人。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　任凭那个男人强如野兽——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　面对人山人海"
"的包围，也毫无办法。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　所以，野兽——⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　最后，还是被民众击败了。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　没有"
"了野兽……修女也失去了护盾。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　她也成为了暴乱的牺牲品。⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　……场上只留下无法阻止"
"的狂热……⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　混乱和绝望。⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　众人已经不知该对什么发泄——⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫　疯狂地寻找"
"施暴的对象。⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫　这次的暴动规模极大，是之前的奴隶叛乱难以比拟的。"

#: search2:search2_C7935711_6F4C_4DFD_BC3B_ECE822B612EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d0c9b8a71c03d4eb5c0c7499001936edc1f51f248caa9b8b54e4749683c9a12
#. default-sha256: ea74b5a7e6e9a52967a60cf05036dbf0c31f5f5ad9621bcadb60a8112be75aa1
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7935711_6F4C_4DFD_BC3B_ECE822B612EE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eventually, their rage found a new target—the lord. ⟪k:2⟫It was only natural, for he "
"⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ the true villain.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫He was the one who had given money—and the witch’s "
"blood—to the church. ⟪k:8⟫He was the one who had profited off it.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫And above all, "
"people often resented those who stood above them. ⟪k:12⟫Particularly in times of unrest.⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The city resounded with cries for the lord’s head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　他们暴动的矛头，最终，转向了领主。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　这不是理所当然嘛。⟪k:3⟫因为真正的敌人就是领"
"主。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　正是领主为教会提供资金，又将魔女的血给予民众。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　从中赚钱的，还是领主。"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　而且，人类这种生物，往往会憎恨地位高的人。⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　若世道不太平，则更是如此。"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　人们齐声呼喊，领主的名字响彻城镇。"

#: search2:search2_53D2C993_3E8B_407C_BE57_8430F4D6FC62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73df4e05c4df0372f74ac866c95a6edf8c84411fa79214e11b9284c5e84fe879
#. default-sha256: 736e00fb1a42e9d94aa516e4e203cac581c8d9566e378bbb2b796d008f52687a
msgctxt "search2:search2_53D2C993_3E8B_407C_BE57_8430F4D6FC62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With that, the raging furor mostly settled down, but it was hardly the end of the "
"destruction. ⟪k:2⟫Mere days later, a plague befell the city.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Dreadful black spots "
"covered the flesh of the infected. ⟪k:6⟫They writhed in pain, screaming and vomiting blood. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Ghastly howls echoed through the streets—as though the whole city had been possessed. ⟪k:8⟫It "
"became a cursed land.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫In their diseased haze, the people muttered again and "
"again,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　虽然暴动迎来了一时的终结，然而，崩坏还在继续。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　不久，领地里出现了传染病。⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫　染上病的人们，皮肤上都会出现骇人的黑色斑块。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　他们痛得翻滚、吐血、哀鸣。⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　整片领地里充斥着鬼哭狼嚎，变成了受诅咒的地方。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　病人经常神志不清地徘徊在生"
"死边缘，不断梦呓。"

#: search2:search2_90684BFF_2F0D_4D0B_B5EB_E8F9CFD38C09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 472556edb4b6283f32a8662c48e1d0364bfe0df14f31a340e4bc43fd8daffcf6
#. default-sha256: 801efa9afe5db1df09c67084359b396a292078f0b6b56540331508e3fed58412
msgctxt "search2:search2_90684BFF_2F0D_4D0B_B5EB_E8F9CFD38C09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“We have been cursed by the witch!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「我们被魔女诅咒了！」"

#: search2:search2_96CB9713_8876_46E6_8C86_85EB9C18DB5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3452aadae4cce853ded119555a6fc348f752b1e2f6af7858e4b4a8494c2dcc89
#. default-sha256: 1de932fcea5ff75db55c8d42c284df9da39b25fb0c18eb2677a94147e1752a33
msgctxt "search2:search2_96CB9713_8876_46E6_8C86_85EB9C18DB5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My body was left abandoned at the top of the observation tower.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And as if "
"to seal the curse away, in their final days, the people shuttered all the windows, wrapping the "
"house in darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　我的尸体就一直被丢弃在瞭望塔里。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　然后，仿佛要把诅咒封住一般——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　所有的"
"窗户都被钉死，一切都沉入幽暗之中。"

#: search2:search2_1CCF9033_B827_4EEE_A611_24DFE73697F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c240c1188d11f15ac674ec7771d4ed5e88fddf0d1bb38cc4968e51e37120d242
#. default-sha256: 54caad6746ca29d02dc03875011ea2fae860fd934caea1bfe3be2c9627e247b8
msgctxt "search2:search2_1CCF9033_B827_4EEE_A611_24DFE73697F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But I wish to believe it ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ a miracle.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That even if my blood "
"didn’t have healing properties, ⟪k:7⟫and even if I wasn’t a saint, ⟪k:8⟫my wish—my curse—⟪k:9⟫was "
"what caused that uprising.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫That ⟪k:13⟫that⟪k:14⟫ was my miracle.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫Granted to me by God—or the Devil.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫I choose to believe that.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫And that my miracle took on its true form thereafter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　但是，我想认为，这才是奇迹。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　我的血并没有治愈的力量——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　我也并非圣女。"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　尽管如此——⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　我的愿望，我的诅咒……⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　引发了这场狂乱。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　"
"这才是奇迹。⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　这是神，或是恶魔——赠予我的。⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　我如此坚信。⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　此"
"后，我的奇迹才真正实现了。"

