msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So I made my next wish.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wished for their reconstruction.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
