msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This was my wish for the flaxen-haired young man:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He treasured his "
"dear sister, and he desired a quiet life, ⟪k:6⟫so I wished for him to have just that. ⟪k:7⟫And I "
"wished for his dearly beloved sister to love him more than anything in the world! ⟪k:8⟫For his "
"world to be destroyed by love gone too far!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　对亚麻色头发的青年，我许下如此之愿——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　既然他发自内心地珍惜妹妹，想过平稳的生活……"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　那么，就如他所愿，让他过上平稳的生活吧。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　我为他许了相同的愿望。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　"
"然后，让他那么珍惜的妹妹——⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　全心全意爱上他吧！⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　让他被过度的爱毁灭吧！"

